WEBVTT

00:08:28.676 --> 00:08:31.756
that even good relationships
need tending to,

00:08:31.796 --> 00:08:33.316
they need attention.

00:08:33.316 --> 00:08:36.196
They need returning to them
over and over again.

00:08:36.516 --> 00:08:40.916
So what are some ways that we can
strengthen our relationships?

00:08:41.436 --> 00:08:45.276
Well, one way is to be proactive,
to take the initiative.

00:08:45.636 --> 00:08:48.076
So to reach out to a friend

00:08:48.076 --> 00:08:51.116
and ask her to take a walk

00:08:51.156 --> 00:08:54.596
instead of spending
two more hours on your laptop

00:08:54.636 --> 00:08:57.356
this weekend on Saturday afternoon.

00:08:58.276 --> 00:09:00.556
Establish some routines with the people